%% Public-safe operational triage flow based on the technical paper and notes.
flowchart TD
    Fail[Render job failed or stalled] --> Reached{Job reached Deadline?}
    Reached -- No --> SubmitCheck[Check UI submission, deadlinecommand, MongoDB reservation]
    Reached -- Yes --> Workers{Workers online?}
    Workers -- No --> WorkerFix[Restart Worker, check network, pool/group, permissions]
    Workers -- Yes --> Logs[Open failed task log]

    Logs --> Category{Failure category}
    Category --> DB[MongoDB / reservation]
    Category --> Repo[Repository access]
    Category --> License[Arnold license]
    Category --> OCIO[OCIO config]
    Category --> Path[NAS / UNC path]
    Category --> DCC[DCC plugin or scene issue]

    DB --> Fix[Apply fix and document sanitized cause]
    Repo --> Fix
    License --> Fix
    OCIO --> Fix
    Path --> Fix
    DCC --> Fix

    Fix --> Test[Render small frame range]
    Test --> Requeue{Successful?}
    Requeue -- Yes --> Full[Requeue full job]
    Requeue -- No --> Logs
